                                            "Greeting in paradise (Surat Al-Raad)",
                                            "Surat Al-Zuhruf",
                                            "Surat Maryam",
                                            "Surat Al-Furqan",
                                            "Traditional African practices (blood pacts, role of beer, traditional/cultural leaders)"
